{"kind":"request","text":"CDF-1: three checks that the review of the cutover left for a\nlater head. They come from the checker's verdicts f6778205 and\n8c301388. They finish before the cutover deployment.\n\n1. Scope-typed fields. `fitsFieldType`\n   (`packages/bytes/src/field-value.ts`) no longer compares the\n   kind of a reference (ruling 429c1be7). A reference of another\n   kind can sit in a typed slot. The checker found no read site\n   that trusts such a slot, and did not read all 36 scope-typed\n   platform fields. Read each field. For each one, name each read\n   site and the check that it runs. A read site that trusts the\n   slot gets a check and a refusal pair.\n2. Timed turns. A timed turn calls `#seal` with no fetched facts\n   (`packages/scope/src/turn.ts:401`), so it retains no birth.\n   That is correct only if a timed draft never uses a later entry\n   of another sequence that no earlier entry used. Trace\n   `judgeTimed` and state the result. If a timed draft can use\n   one, add the witness and the fix.\n3. Retained births. A scope without the opt-in capacity check has\n   no byte cap on the births that it retains. State the largest\n   size that one member can cause in such a scope, and the bound\n   that gives the number. If no bound holds, propose one.\n\nFirst send me one act with the three results. The work to that\npoint is a read and changes no file. A head follows only for a\nresult that asks for a change. Add each result to the section\n\"Faults found after the composed head\" of\n`notes/implementation/cd-dropped-kind-checks.md` in that head, or\nin IDR-1 if no source changes.\n\nNeeds: the cutover head on main (57e893c0). CDF-1 runs beside\nCF-1.","body":{"conditions":"The planner accepts the act with the three results. A head lands only for a result that asks for a change, with the gate passed on AC power and the checker's approval.","target_head":"57e893c01c1a0ae34af7e62a077513743ddcbb4c","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}